1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:06,963
The third meeting of the congress was held in a pub down the road from city hall, and the missing voice was already there.

2
00:00:06,963 --> 00:00:12,383
“The claim is that the fee is free,” a cleaner from the county said.

3
00:00:12,383 --> 00:00:26,141
“The truth is that the benefit passes down to the base and never reaches us.” The budget for the treatment plant contained a sum of eight million euro and no line for the people who would pay it.

4
00:00:26,141 --> 00:00:33,940
“We have a procedure, a species of language, and an internal review,” the mayor said.

5
00:00:33,940 --> 00:00:42,634
“That is how a republic works.” She was obedient to the rule and wholly unaware that the rule had a limitation.

6
00:00:42,634 --> 00:00:49,079
“Every revolution begins with a small accumulation of annoyance,” the cleaner said.

7
00:00:49,079 --> 00:00:52,929
“This is the seven hundredth one.”

8
00:00:52,929 --> 00:01:03,322
The consultant from the bureau showed a slide about productivity and evolution, and a second about the operational capability of the new plant.

9
00:01:03,322 --> 00:01:10,152
“A superior design is not the same as a deed,” an economist in the row behind said.

10
00:01:10,152 --> 00:01:17,891
“You have found a tragedy, not a plan, and the underground pipe is misleading.”

11
00:01:17,891 --> 00:01:24,121
“Do not undermine the small businesses and call it virtue,” the cleaner said.

12
00:01:24,121 --> 00:01:40,424
“A civilian and a governor both drink the same water.” The ministerial party, the dance hall, the disco, and the pub had all sent someone, and the nationality of the taxpayer was never mentioned.

13
00:01:40,424 --> 00:01:50,668
The embarrassment of the meeting was the set of two maps: one showing the eight districts that would pay, and one showing the five that would drink.

14
00:01:50,668 --> 00:01:54,918
“We probably need a third map,” Maya wrote.

15
00:01:54,918 --> 00:02:01,522
“The same oil, the same pipe, and a different set of names.”

16
00:02:01,522 --> 00:02:06,517
The voice that had been missing turned out to contain the whole argument.

17
00:02:06,517 --> 00:02:19,755
“Show us the passage of the money,” the cleaner said, “and the world will decide for itself.” The meeting ended without a vote, and the next one was set for the following week.

18
00:02:19,755 --> 00:02:31,854
The evidence would confront the council with a twist it did not want; an aid package and a supper in the pub were not a settlement, and the county knew it.
